Error [E0320]: typed collection construction uses `[T]{…}`, not `[T].{…}`
  --> tests/ui/binpat_multibyte_needs_endian.jet:2:17
    |
  2 |     data :: [U8].{ 0, 40 }
    |                 ^
 Why: D-LIT-DOT1 drops the constructor dot from every literal head
 Fix: write `[T]{…}`

Error [E0320]: typed pattern construction uses `[U8]{…}`, not `[U8].{…}`
  --> tests/ui/binpat_multibyte_needs_endian.jet:4:13
    |
  4 |         [U8].{"{len:U16}"} -> { print("len {len}") }
    |             ^
 Why: D-LIT-DOT1 drops the constructor dot from every literal head
 Fix: write `[U8]{…}`

Error [E1008]: `{…:U16}` reads more than one byte, so it needs a byte order
  --> tests/ui/binpat_multibyte_needs_endian.jet:4:21
    |
  4 |         [U8].{"{len:U16}"} -> { print("len {len}") }
    |                     ^^^
 Why: a read wider than 8 bits spans multiple bytes; Jet won't guess big- vs little-endian
 Fix: write `U16be` (big-endian / network order) or `U16le` (little-endian)
